    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:overview:0008:0001",
      "source": "This structure represents the 3x2 matrix :",
      "ko": "이 구조체는 3x2 행렬을 나타냅니다:",
      "sourceHash": "96f02d9cdd33281c73a3f1dbd1655a881acc50ae8a1010656c20d9f6bccd39ea",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:overview:0009:0001",
      "source": "![3 by 2 matrix](https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/15175700351555931d77e36e3b8efd15/media-2557524.gif)",
      "ko": "![3 by 2 matrix](https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/15175700351555931d77e36e3b8efd15/media-2557524.gif)",
      "sourceHash": "6974c4c507bd4173a74125d907f7aa6044fa2953fad9002abeddc5afd13dfcee",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:overview:0010:0001",
      "source": "In 64-bit applications, this structure is just like the Core Graphics [`CGAffineTransform`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/CoreFoundation/CGAffineTransform) data structure.",
      "ko": "64비트 애플리케이션에서 이 구조체는 Core Graphics [`CGAffineTransform`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/CoreFoundation/CGAffineTransform) 데이터 구조체와 동일합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "fa1699b961d59fc2cdee4de5d7efda530d143ffa3974bc7aeef3068674d0b95b",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:overview:0010:0002",
      "source": "In 32-bit applications, the Core Graphics data structure is equivalent to [`vImage_AffineTransform`](vimage_affinetransform.md).",
      "ko": "32비트 애플리케이션에서 Core Graphics 데이터 구조는 [`vImage_AffineTransform`](vimage_affinetransform.md)와 같습니다.",
      "sourceHash": "d463d2c42533019109568049b2b29a94db2ba9817dd86e1beefd1c032eec6061",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:overview:0010:0003",
      "source": "Most of the time, you should use the [`vImage_CGAffineTransform`](vimage_cgaffinetransform.md) data structure, which changes size depending on architecture.",
      "ko": "대부분의 경우 아키텍처에 따라 크기가 달라지는 [`vImage_CGAffineTransform`](vimage_cgaffinetransform.md) 데이터 구조를 사용해야 합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "348131bf23d9e88a0d57fea442323d0a3560515234ee8552c02c5bc92ed953c9",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:overview:0011:0001",
      "source": "The [`CGAffineTransform`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/CoreGraphics/cgaffinetransform) describes functions for creating and manipulating matrixes of this form.",
      "ko": "[`CGAffineTransform`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/CoreGraphics/cgaffinetransform)은 이 형식의 행렬을 생성하고 조작하는 함수를 설명합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "9ab793f2f92139b24d823e74bf9e9dac8f555722cafa9fe1b362417c088a0e4f",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
